author: "harness:claude-code"
resolution: "Bumped pm-changelog to 2026.9.2, which accepts a same-day -N suffix on the calendar version."
expected_result: A second release on one calendar day generates its changelog from the suffixed version and publishes.
actual_result: "The pinned 2026.8.17 rejected 2026.9.6-1, so the job failed before publishing and npm stayed on the previous version."
